  "components": [],
  "description": {
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1,
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 2
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Summary"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Users can clear all active filters at once or clear individual filter selections, and they see a helpful empty state when no records match, so they're never stuck on a blank screen without guidance."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 2
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Context"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "bulletList",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "The user is on the Work Orders page"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "One or more filters may be active, and/or a search query may be active (Story 13)"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 2
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Requirements"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "orderedList",
     "attrs": {
      "order": 1
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "\"Clear filters\" removes all active filter selections across all filters; all chips return to their default (inactive) state \u2014 ("
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "PRD: Story 8, S8-R1",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "link",
             "attrs": {
              "href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/shopviewapp/pages/572030978/Filters#Story-8:-Clearing-Filters-&-Empty-State"
             }
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": ")"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Each filter dropdown includes a \"Clear selection\" action that removes only that filter's selections without affecting others \u2014 ("
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "PRD: Story 8, S8-R2",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "link",
             "attrs": {
              "href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/shopviewapp/pages/572030978/Filters#Story-8:-Clearing-Filters-&-Empty-State"
             }
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": ")"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "When filters and/or search produce no matching records, the table shows an empty state with a message indicating no results \u2014 ("
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "PRD: Story 8, S8-R3",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "link",
             "attrs": {
              "href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/shopviewapp/pages/572030978/Filters#Story-8:-Clearing-Filters-&-Empty-State"
             }
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": ")"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "The empty state includes prompts to clear filters and, where a search query is active, to clear the query \u2014 ("
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "PRD: Story 8, S8-R4",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "link",
             "attrs": {
              "href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/shopviewapp/pages/572030978/Filters#Story-8:-Clearing-Filters-&-Empty-State"
             }
